    <string name="hakkinda_lisans">Terms of use</string>
    <string name="hakkinda_lisans_metni">This application is a MAVLink bridge for the GOKTUNGU ground control system. It carries MAVLink frames from the flight controller to the central software without modification. Because telemetry is sent unencrypted, connections are permitted only to private network addresses. Flight safety remains the responsibility of the operator; the bridge performs no flight control, it only carries communication.</string>
